      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Elon is right to demand answers.\n\nIndia once had more than a dozen telecom operators competing for customers. Today, Jio and Airtel account for nearly 77% of India’s wireless subscriptions.\n\nWhat is the harm in adding another competitor? Healthy competition encourages providers to offer better prices and service, giving consumers more choice and better value.\n\nStarlink could offer Indian households, businesses and communities another broadband option, especially in remote villages, mountains and islands where expanding existing networks is difficult.\n\nIndians deserve greater transparency, better connectivity and the freedom to choose. Let Starlink compete and let consumers decide.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {},
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2108231815366656468",
      "images": [],
