      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "🚨 SPACEXAI BACKS OPEN SOURCE LINUX WITH $1.5 MILLION\n\nSpaceXAI is donating $1.5 million in Grok tokens to support Omarchy, the open-source Linux system from DHH.\n\nGrok 4.7 will power AI agents that review code. Developers can use the tokens to fix bugs, build features, and get Omarchy running on more hardware.",
